 <div class="Example"><a name="_09bbfe64-5efe-1b78-38cc-41ff4dde9e5b" id="_09bbfe64-5efe-1b78-38cc-41ff4dde9e5b"></a><p class="Example"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Unique identifiers can be unique product identifier, unique facility identifier, unique operator identifier of the economic operator etc.</p></div><p class="Source">[SOURCE: <a href="#EN18222"><span class="stdpublisher">CEN&#xA0;EN</span>&#xA0;<span class="stddocNumber">18222</span>:<span class="stdyear">2026</span>,  <span class="citesec">3.6</span></a><a href="#EN18222"><sup>[58]</sup></a>
